<BaseLayout title="Why Multi-Assistant — TotalRecalls" description="Switching providers and cross-assistant workflows.">
  <h1>Why Multi-Assistant</h1>
  <p>You don't use just one AI. You switch between ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, and Grok. TotalRecalls unifies them all into one library.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Unified search.</strong> Find any conversation, from any provider, in one place.</li>
    <li><strong>Cross-assistant workflows.</strong> Use Claude for research, ChatGPT for coding, Grok for quick takes—all backed up.</li>
    <li><strong>Future-proof.</strong> If you switch providers, your history moves with you.</li>
  </ul>
